+      "method": "T7's categories do not overlap, so today's wall is their sum. With the disc read moved off the CPU, a chunk costs the LARGER of the two instead: max(CPU work, disc). An ideal upper bound; real double-buffering has switching costs and cannot overlap the first and last chunk."
