+    "The probe polls with sleeps rather than taking the DMA-end interrupt, so a production design could do slightly better.",
+    "The projection assumes a double-buffered loop with free switching; it cannot overlap the first read or the last write, and the real engine must still checkpoint, retry and cancel correctly."
+  ]
